### ==========================================
### AI 能力模块 API 测试
### ==========================================

### 0. 获取 Token
# @name login
POST http://localhost:18081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "XiyuAdmin2026!"
}

@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 1. 正常流程：获取 AI 配置
GET http://localhost:18081/api/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. 正常流程：测试 AI 连接
POST http://localhost:18081/api/settings/ai-models/test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "openai",
  "model": "gpt-4"
}

### 3. 正常流程：获取 AI 分析
GET http://localhost:18081/api/tenders/1/match-score/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. 正常流程：AI 评分历史
GET http://localhost:18081/api/tenders/1/match-score/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. 正常流程：AI 最新评分
GET http://localhost:18081/api/tenders/1/match-score/latest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. 正常流程：知识库搜索（AI 方案检索用）
GET http://localhost:18081/api/knowledge/cases?page=0&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. 边界：不存在的标讯 AI 分析
GET http://localhost:18081/api/tenders/999999/match-score/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. 正常流程：标书质量核查——触发异步任务（spec 049，需项目已上传 BID 类投标文件）
# 将 {projectId} 替换为已上传投标文件的项目 ID
POST http://localhost:18081/api/compliance/bid-quality/trigger/1?force=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. 边界：标书质量核查——无投标文件项目触发应返回 4xx（spec 049 US1 G3）
# 预期：HTTP 422，message = "无法执行核查，请先上传投标文件"，不创建任务
# 将 {projectId} 替换为未上传任何投标文件的项目 ID
POST http://localhost:18081/api/compliance/bid-quality/trigger/2?force=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
